 (start 201.6 22) (end 350.3 269.06) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 51bce1b7-9265-443b-a120-228b0eb76b9a)) (text "MCU: ATmega328P-AU, 16 MHz, ISP and UART header" (at 203.1 25 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left)) (uuid 91276033-3842-4a04-83da-d9e92f2c0cb0)) (rectangle (start 356.3 22) (end 522.3 129.24) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid e0896db5-05fe-4b19-8ed8-1518165da77d)) (text "SENSOR: MQ-6 module socket, filtered analog input, battery divider" (at 357.8 25 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left)) (uuid c01a611a-8b4e-4d4f-8820-ca90eae12f9d)) (rectangle (start 528.3 22) (end 688.3 191.4) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 050001f8-e3ad-4b37-b480-9ff4b261ab03)) (text "ALARM: active buzzer, three LEDs, silence and test buttons" (at 529.8 25 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left)) (uuid a238d8e0-a539-42fe-a2db-118b32bdc087)) (text "Gas-Suraksha PROTOTYPE / DATA-LOGGING BOARD, NOT A CERTIFIED GAS DETECTOR. It carries the alarm engine from" (at 20 277.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid e79bbce7-d6ad-4170-be94-20c6a07c8cb4)) (text "firmware/lib/gas_core on an ATmega328P with a socket for a common MQ-6 module (VCC, GND, DO, AO: check your" (at 20 280.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid c807ba70-1864-4bed-b209-e082c6a764dc)) (text "module's pin order). USB-C 5 V and a 3xAA pack are OR-ed through Schottky diodes into VSYS (about 4.1 to 4.7" (at 20 283.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 0f694c35-002c-43ce-97da-04b7f27b95e1)) (text "V): the MQ-6 heater sees this, so calibrate readings per supply. The ACTIVE 3 V buzzer is fed through 47 ohm;" (at 20 287.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid a4f9edcd-873d-4885-aef5-5101731187ce)) (text "the firmware switches pin D8 on and off. D11 (red LED) shares the MOSI line like an Arduino D13 LED. Program" (at 20 290.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 43b6794f-0af4-4fca-a41b-df1296272828)) (text "through the ISP header (firmware/release/gas_suraksha_demo.hex, 16 MHz, external crystal fuses); read logs on" (at 20 294.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid dae6fc20-c61a-4a63-93f9-c7c2b917d08d)) (text "the UART header at 115200 baud. Do not sell or rely on it as a safety device." (at 20 297.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 6cc86d4b-9bd7-449b-aba7-4745b97d7ad1)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))